    "title": "Lolly Ackermann, former Pingry athlete, listed for college action week ending Sept. 6",
    "text": "Lolly Ackermann, former Pingry athlete, listed for college action week ending Sept. 6\nBy\nG. M. RivasLolly Ackermann, a former Pingry High School athlete, appears on La Verne's field hockey roster for the week ending Sept. 6. La Verne is scheduled to host Temple on Sept. 4.\nThe schedule for the week shows two field hockey events for Ackermann, with La Verne and Lafayette listed as her college teams.\nAckermann is listed for two college field hockey events on Sept. 4, with both games scheduled as home matchups against Temple in Easton, Pennsylvania.",
